    separators: yellow(4) lines at positions 3,7,11,15,19; one row and one col separator removed for instruction region
  instruction_region:
    location: 6x6 block in one of the 4 corners, spanning 2x2 adjacent cells where the shared separator is removed
    positions: (1,1) top-left, (1,16) top-right, (16,1) bottom-left, (16,16) bottom-right
    border: fully surrounded by yellow (adjacent separators + grid-edge row/col which becomes all-yellow)
    encoding: 3x3 binary mask via 2x2 sub-blocks; solid accent = on, solid empty(0) = off; no partial blocks
